rts":[{"text":"அறிவுகாழ்க்","lemma":"அறிவுகாழ்க்","gloss":"maturity of mind"}],"gloss":"maturity of mind","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொள்ளும்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளும்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"attaining"}],"gloss":"attaining"},{"surface":"அளவைச்","parts":[{"text":"அளவைச்","lemma":"அளவைச்","gloss":"at the time of"}],"gloss":"at the time of","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செறிதொடி","parts":[{"text":"செறி","lemma":"செறி","gloss":"tight"},{"text":"தொடி","lemma":"தொடி","gloss":"bracelet"}],"gloss":"O you with tight bracelets"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எம்மில்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"our"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house"}],"gloss":"to our house"},{"surface":"வருகுவை","parts":[{"text":"வருகுவை","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"you will come"}],"gloss":"you will come"},{"surface":"நீயெனப்","parts":[{"text":"நீயெனப்","lemma":"நீயெனப்","gloss":"saying 'you'"}],"gloss":"saying 'you'","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொம்மல்","parts":[{"text":"பொம்மல்","lemma":"பொம்மல்","gloss":"thick"}],"gloss":"thick"},{"surface":"ஓதி","parts":[{"text":"ஓதி","lemma":"ஓதி","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"நீவியோனே","parts":[{"text":"நீவியோனே","lemma":"நீவு","gloss":"he who stroked"}],"gloss":"he who stroked"}]}],"literal":"Today where is the lord, O friend, of the hill / where the forest-dweller digging an ancient pit obtains pure gems of wide space along with the tuber, / who, saying 'you will come to our house when you attain maturity of mind', / stroked your thick hair, O you with tight bracelets!","translation":"Where is he today, O friend? The lord of the mountain land where a forest-dweller, digging into an ancient pit for tubers, finds wide, pure gems instead. He is the one who stroked your thick, beautiful hair, saying, 'You will come to my house when you are mature enough,' O you with tight-fitting bracelets!","modern":"தோழியே! குன்றில் உள்ள பழைய குழியைத் தோண்டிய கானவன், கிழங்குடன் கூடவே அகன்ற இடத்தையுடைய தூய மணிகளையும் பெறுகின்ற நாட்டின் தலைவன் இன்று எங்கே இருக்கிறான்? 'அறிவு முதிர்ச்சி அடையும் காலத்தில், நெருங்கிய வளையல்களை அணிந்தவளே, நீ எமது வீட்டிற்கு வருவாய்' என்று கூறி, உனது அடர்ந்த கூந்தலை வருடிச் சென்றானே அவன்!","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the heroine in this Kuriñci poem. The hero has gone away to prepare for their marriage, and the friend comforts the anxious heroine by reminding her of his promise. She recalls how the hero stroked the heroine's thick hair and promised to take her to his home once she attained maturity. The description of the forest-dweller digging for humble tubers but finding precious, pure gems is an implied metaphor (uḷḷurai). It signifies that while the hero initially sought simple pleasure, he discovered a priceless treasure in the heroine's virtue and love. Key words include 'நாடன்' (lord of the land) and 'அறிவுகாழ்க் கொள்ளும்' (attaining maturity).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,3.5],[3.5,4.3],[4.3,4.4],[4.4,5.6],[5.6,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,7.5],[7.5,7.94],[7.94,8.2],[8.2,8.7],[8.7,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.3],[10.3,11.3],[11.3,11.6],[11.6,12.0],[12.0,12.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[1.1,1.2],[1.4,1.65],[1.65,1.8],[1.8,3.2],[3.2,3.8],[3.8,3.8],[3.8,4.6],[4.7,5.7],[5.7,6.2],[6.2,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,7.4],[7.4,7.4],[7.4,9.3],[9.4,9.6],[9.65,9.8],[9.8,11.0],[11.2,11.4],[11.4,12.6],[12.6,13.0],[13.0,13.4],[13.4,13.7]]},"sync":[[["இன்று","today"],["யாண்டு","where"]],[["யாண்டு","where"],["ஐயனோ","the lord?"]],[["தோழி","O friend"]],[["குன்றத்து","of the hill"]],[["பழங்குழி","ancient pit"]],[["அகழ்ந்த","that was dug"]],[["கானவன்","the forest-dweller"]],[["கிழங்கினொடு","along with the tuber"]],[["கண்ணகன்","wide-spaced"]],[["தூமணி","pure gems"]],[["பெறூஉம்","obtaining"]],[["நாடன்","the lord of the land"]],[["அறிவுகாழ்க்","maturity of mind"]],[["கொள்ளும்","attaining"]],[["அளவைச்","at the time of"]],[["செறிதொடி","O you with tight bracelets"]],[["எம்மில்","to our house"]],[["வருகுவை","you will come"]],[["நீயெனப்","saying 'you'"]],[["பொம்மல்","thick"]],[["ஓதி","hair"]],[["நீவியோனே","he who stroked"]],[["நீவியோனே","he who stroked"]]]}